  "question": {
    "text": "An aqueous solution of X is added slowly to an aqueous solution of Y as shown in List I. The variation in conductivity of these reactions is given in List II. Match List I with List II and select the correct using answer the code given below the lists :<br />&nbsp;<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><strong>List II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>a.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>5</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mtext>N</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>CH</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mtext>COOH</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>X</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Y</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td>p.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Conductivity decreases and then&nbsp;<br />\t\t\tincreases&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>b.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>KI</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>AgNO</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>.</mtext> <mn>0</mn> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>M</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>X</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Y</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td>q.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Conductivity decreases and then<br />\t\t\tdoes not change much&nbsp;</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>c.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>CH</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> <mtext>COOH</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>KOH</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>X</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Y</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td>r.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Conductivity increases and then<br />\t\t\tdoes not change much</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>d.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>NaOH</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>HI</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>X</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>Y</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td>s.&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Conductivity does not change much and&nbsp;<br />\t\t\tthen increases</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>"
